    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af3e51ebb7aaa3cca0d0611a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——咚。\r\n巨大的冲击将我整个人抛飞起来，\r\n浑身上下的血此刻仿佛都开始往心脏倒流……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3633ef6842359a8116927bd326d3d9a2ad6283e34ab0ed070b9b51943150caee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
