    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a096a4c8954ab96478d2e573",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "万物在此刻都好像静止下来，只有她仍在活动。\r\n少女踏出的每一步都在让她不断增速；\r\n接着，她猛然跃向空中……",
      "source_fingerprint": "563f954853412129631a0d4409546cd1744766cf9272df2bd4ba81d23ba9e93b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
